class RemoteBrainCapability(TypedDict):
    """Contract 1.4.0. The machine's owner allows a brain that runs on another machine to use this machine as its hands (platform tools routed here for a session whose brain machine is a different one). Set only by the executor's local configuration (bmad configuration or SDK Options.RemoteBrain); the platform reads it back and cannot switch it on through any API. Absent or enabled=false: off, which is also what an executor that predates 1.4.0 means. It applies to a BYO (tenant-owned) machine; a platform pool machine does not need it. It does not restrict a platform-hosted brain driving this machine (project authorization is enough there), and a brain and hands on one machine never need it."""
    enabled: bool

