class SessionFilesCapability(TypedDict):
    """Executor-owned per-session file layout. The harness derives <root>/<agent_session_id>/uploads (read-only session inputs) and <root>/<agent_session_id>/outputs (deliverables) from it, with agent_session_id as sent in process.start metadata, and uses these real paths in prompts, tool descriptions, write rules and the session files manifest. Absent: the executor has no session files; the harness names no session path to it. There is no fixed /mnt/session/uploads or /mnt/session/outputs layout: the per-session <root>/<agent_session_id>/{uploads,outputs} is the only one, and platform-hosted machines declare root /mnt/session. With the fs capability skills_per_session the same tree also holds <root>/<agent_session_id>/skills (the session's skills view, read-only). Fixed at executor.register: executor.capabilities.update does not change it. Machine-scoped executors only."""
    root: str

